a-600/5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-fuchsia-700 dark:text-fuchsia-300\">#<!-- -->FinTech</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-fuchsia-500/30 bg-fuchsia-600/5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-fuchsia-700 dark:text-fuchsia-300\">#<!-- -->Neobank</span></div><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-4xl\">Investment Opportunities: Banking Financial Software: Advanced Neo Bank ++ (1)</h1><div class=\"relative mt-7 aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"Investment Opportunities: Banking Financial Software: Advanced Neo Bank ++ (1)\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2FAccounting-software-0.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1>We have previously explained the <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%aa%db%8c%d9%85-%d8%b3%d8%a7%d8%b2%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d8%a8%d9%87-%da%86%d9%87-%d8%b5%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%a8%d8%a7%db%8c%d8%af-%d8%a8/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a> of Neo Bank ++ in Mehrdad's <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir\" rel=\"noopener\">website</a>, here we want to examine banking and neo banking financial systems</h1>\nsrc=\"/media/Accounting-software-0-1024x402.jpg\"Banking Financial Systems- Mehrdad Website\n<h2>Banking financial systems refer to all the processes and systems used in banks to manage, process, and interact with customers and their accounts. These systems operate through computer networks and secure platforms used for transferring information.</h2>\n<h3>Features of banking financial systems include:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Account Management: Banks use systems that allow them to process banking transactions, check account balances, view payment statuses, and provide clear reports of all financial activities.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Electronic Payments: Banks use electronic payments to facilitate financial transactions between individuals. These payments can be made through bank cards, mobile phones, the internet, mobile banking, and so on.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Issuing and Managing Bank Cards: Banks issue physical or virtual bank cards to provide better services to their customers. Banking financial systems provide facilities for managing bank cards, including issuance, security, integration with other banking systems, and more.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Credit Management: Banks use financial systems to review and verify their customers' credit to ensure successful payments. These systems can use various criteria to assess customer credit, including payment history, credit score, income, and assets.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Stock Market: Stock market financial systems use advanced and highly complex systems to manage stock market transactions. These systems are used to manage securities trading, market analysis, predictive information, and more.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Risk Management: Banks use advanced systems to review and assess financial risk to reduce financial risks. These systems can identify risks that could cause financial damage to the bank and customers, and provide solutions to mitigate them.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Security Systems: Information security is extremely important in financial systems. Banks use security systems to protect customer information and prevent unauthorized access. These systems include firewalls, encryption, intrusion detection, monitoring, and more.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>In general, banking financial systems are used to manage financial transactions, customers, and bank accounts, and use advanced technologies to provide better services and improve banking processes. Since these systems are highly sensitive, security and stability are very important for them. For this reason, these systems are continuously updated and receive necessary changes and improvements when needed.</h4>\n<h4>The use of banking financial systems contributes to the growth and development of a country's economy by creating banking facilities, increasing trade and economic exchanges. Additionally, by using these systems, bank customers can easily conduct their transactions and benefit from the various financial services offered by banks.</h4>\n<h4>Given that banking financial systems are very complex, for those intending to enter this field, learning and understanding the relevant concepts is crucial. For this reason, various educational courses and universities offer academic programs related to banking finance to help individuals acquire the necessary skills to enter this industry.</h4>\n\n<h1>What is a Neo Bank?</h1>\n\n<h4>Neo bank or new bank is a term used to describe banks that operate completely online without physical branches, using modern technologies. These banks strive to attract new customers by offering flexible, technology-based services and reducing costs compared to traditional banks.</h4>\n<h4>Neo banks typically offer a wide range of financial services, including bank account management, financial transaction reviews, credit cards, bank loans, and other financial services. These banks are usually only accessible to their customers through their applications and websites.</h4>\n<h4>One of the main advantages of neo banks is that in many cases, their online services provide significantly faster and more services to their customers. These types of banks can also reduce the costs typically required for building a physical branch, including rent, equipment, personnel, and other expenses.</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/accounting-software.jpeg\"What is a Neo Bank? Mehrdad Website\n\n<h2>What are the best neo banks in the world?</h2>\n\n\n\n\n<h3>Neo banks or <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%85%d8%a7-2/\" rel=\"noopener\">digital banks</a> have recently become very popular, and continuously, new banks and online financial services are growing to compete with traditional banks. Below are some of the best neo banks in the world:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>N26: One of the leading neo banks in Europe, currently operating in more than 25 countries worldwide. This bank uses new technologies and offers its customers a wide range of financial services, including credit cards and online banking.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Revolut: A British neo bank founded in 2015, currently operating in more than 35 countries worldwide. This bank offers its customers a wide range of services, including credit cards and online banking.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Chime: An American neo bank that currently operates with more than 3 million user accounts. This bank offers its customers a wide range of financial services, including credit cards and online banking, along with money management and budgeting tools.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Monzo: Another British neo bank founded in 2015, currently operating in more than 20 countries worldwide. This bank offers its customers a wide range of services, including credit cards and online banking, money management and budgeting tools, along with an intelligent system for notifying customers of purchases and controlling bank card theft.</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Ally Bank: An American neo bank founded in 2006. This bank offers its customers online banking services, including credit cards, checking and savings accounts, loans, stock market services, and insurance.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Varo: An American neo bank founded in 2017, offering its customers online banking services. This bank offers its customers a wide range of services, including credit cards, checking and savings accounts, loans, stock market services, and insurance.</h4>\n</li>\n<li><h4>Monese: A British neobank founded in 2013 that provides online banking services to its customers. This bank offers its customers a wide range of services including credit cards and online banking, current accounts, savings, loans, and insurance.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>The most important feature of <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%ad-%d8%a7%d9%88%d9%84%db%8c%d9%87-pitch-deck-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%86%da%a9%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%a6%d9%88-%d8%a8%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">neobanks</a>, is the convenience and speed in providing banking services to customers. Additionally, these neobanks give their users better money and budget management capabilities, thanks to smart financial systems and the ability to connect with various financial management applications. However, it is always better to research and ensure that any bank you choose meets your financial needs and lifestyle. For example, if you are an investor looking for stock market services, a bank that does not offer these services will not be useful to you.</h4>\n<h4>Furthermore, some neobanks also require specific conditions to access their services, such as a minimum balance in the account, so be sure to read the terms and conditions before choosing a neobank.</h4>\n<h4>Overall, neobanks, by offering online and fast services, are on the path to changing the banking industry towards technology and data-based services, and are the best option for many people. However, before choosing a bank, you should always carefully review its terms and services and make the decision that best meets your needs.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n\n<h4></h4>\n\n<h2>What features does Revolut neobank have?</h2>\n\n\n\n<h4>It is a neobank (fintech) registered in the United Kingdom and provides banking services online. This bank offers its users various features that include the following:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Multiple accounts: With this feature, users can easily create multiple accounts for taxes, savings, and expenses.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Prepaid cards: Revolut offers its users MasterCard and Visa prepaid cards with NFC technology.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Digital currencies: This neobank allows its users to buy and sell more than 30 digital currencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, and Ripple.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>International money transfer: Revolut allows its users to easily send and receive money to other countries.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Stock trading and stock market-related services: This bank offers its users the ability to buy and sell stocks and various stock market products online.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Access to digital wallet: This bank allows its users to manage their cash and cards through its digital wallet application.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Customer support: Revolut provides its users with 24/7 support services through its support team.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4>Considering these features, it can be said that Revolut is one of the most popular neobanks in the world. Currently, the bank operates in more than 30 countries worldwide, including Europe, the United States, Australia, and Singapore, and provides banking services to more than 15 million internet users.</h4>\n\n\n\n\n<h4>It can be said that this bank, by offering various and modern services, has managed to gain the trust of its users and has become one of the top neobanks in the world in recent years.</h4>\n\n\n\n\n<h3>How many users does Revolut have?</h3>\n<h4>Revolut currently has over 20 million users worldwide. The bank started its operations in 2015 and has become one of the top neobanks in the world in recent years.</h4>\n\n<h3>What is the value of this bank?</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4>The value of Revolut bank, based on the valuation of its latest investment round in September 2021, is approximately 33 billion US dollars. This value is much higher compared to 2020, which was about 5.5 billion dollars, and shows the significant growth of this bank in recent years. In any case, it should be noted that this value is actually an estimate and may change with changes in market conditions.</h4>\n\n<h5>In the next articles, we will talk about other neobanks and financial systems</h5>\n<h5>Thank you, Mehrdad</h5>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Short Link:<br />\n<a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/h9sp\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://mehrdad.ir/h9sp</strong></a></p></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP 